sec.p:
The step-by-step protocol to compute ISRGDF15 scores, outlined in full in the code associated to this article, includes the following steps:
If values are in FPKM, transform to TPM: TPM = (FPKM / Σ FPKM) × 10⁶
Log2 transform: Expression = log₂(TPM + 1)
To ensure comparability with the original fibroblast-derived factor scores, gene expression values in the validation datasets were standardized using the mean (μ) and standard deviation (σ) parameters calculated from the fibroblast training data:\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
